# Buildin Samfile for the samfileparser Lib
#
# Every Task here starts with _build_in_
# This tasks are automaticly in the libary, feel free to use them
# You can copy them if you want, the are under Appache 2.0 license by Shadowdara
#
# More Infos about samfiles
# https://shadowdara.wordpress.com/2026/07/02/samfile/
#
# https://shadowdara.github.io/docs/#/samfile


# INFO
# dont name your tasks starting: _build_in_
# This could lead to errors!

# Compiling
# all the comments get removed from the build.rs file!
# so no worries that they will slow down the parser
# target\debug\build\samfileparser-947b3b80d6e6026e\out\builtin_filtered.rs


// The Banner are from (link) with 'Banner3' as the Font and 'Box drawings light' for
// the frame
// https://www.asciiart.eu/text-to-ascii-art


// ┌─────────────────────────────────────┐
// │  #####        #######        #####  │
// │ ##   ##      ##     ##      ##   ## │
// │##     ##            ##     ##     ##│
// │##     ##      #######      ##     ##│
